      "en": "All the souls who came out of Jacob’s body were seventy souls, and Joseph was in Egypt already.",
      "ko": "이미 애굽에 있는 요셉까지 야곱의 혈속이 모두 칠십인이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "1c2d80e4425d09edcaa4c49e9d1ede65b032b8f6ad6d8e05f7d3b2bd97430979",
