      "en": "Joseph died, as did all his brothers, and all that generation.",
      "ko": "요셉과 그의 모든 형제와 그 시대 사람은 다 죽었고",
      "source_text_hash": "6c8fc062b09a5d480ee21c9d97da16a9dbdad44f8729e2ed43b91aa7560833c1",
      "translation_text_hash": "01ef8445b8159c41ebd46a70e8d6dbdd835fdd30f488a7abfe69aad73a7b9e27",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
