      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "The children of Israel were fruitful, and increased abundantly, and multiplied, and grew exceedingly mighty; and the land was filled with them.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손은 생육이 중다하고 번식하고 창성하고 심히 강대하여 온 땅에 가득하게 되었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "5d7c97adc308efd44ff93a81c7064ae6b33ca01c1c9a9e3e3eaa807c390d5574",
      "translation_text_hash": "644f6dff85e5ed9d1e96f38a364541e84475ebbb097faddca188488a8709fcdd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이스라엘 자손은 생육이 중다하고 번식하고 창성하고 심히 강대하여 온 땅에 가득하게 되었더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "644f6dff85e5ed9d1e96f38a364541e84475ebbb097faddca188488a8709fcdd"
      ]
    },
    {
