      "en": "Now there arose a new king over Egypt, who didn’t know Joseph.",
      "ko": "요셉을 알지 못하는 새 왕이 일어나서 애굽을 다스리더니",
      "source_text_hash": "d7b807166f2cebcf3f071f049ad7f1e25b6b4c9e314cc97f9b7e7c8c97e34d06",
      "translation_text_hash": "0cdf38c8a5ab227428d3581e9bb87fcb0751c01b9ef72e9820aeda4cbc792ef8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
